    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>You've been at this a long time for an anarch, nearly 20 years. You've seen a lot of dreams die. You've still got the guts, the muscle and the cojones to make the masses see the truth and fight the system&mdash;but each night you have to work a little harder to get up and do it all over again. That's all right. You don't mind. You were strong enough to break away from the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla} 20 years ago. You're strong enough to stick to your guns now. You just know enough to be careful, like an old weary alley cat, ready to run and start all over again when the dream dies.</p><h2>Stat Block (as printed)</h2><p><strong>Clan:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZFYurbvAHfaRguYI]{Brujah}<br><strong>Nature:</strong> Rebel<br><strong>Demeanor:</strong> Curmudgeon<br><strong>Generation:</strong> 13th</p><p><strong>Physical (10):</strong> Brawny x2, Brutal x2, Quick x2, Tough x4<br><strong>Social (8):</strong> Commanding x2, Intimidating x4, Magnetic x2<br><strong>Mental (9):</strong> Cunning x3, Determined x3, Patient x3, Violent (N)</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Brawl 3, Dodge 3, Drive 3, Firearms 3, Intimidation 2, Leadership 2, Lore (Anarch) 1, Melee 2, Security 2, Stealth 2, Streetwise 4</p><p><strong>Disciplines:</strong> Celerity (Alacrity, Swiftness, Rapidity); Potence (Prowess, Might, Vigor); Presence (Awe, Dread Gaze)</p><p><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> Contacts x3, Influence: Police x1, Influence: Street x3, Influence: Underworld x1, Resources x2<br><strong>Virtues:</strong> Conscience 3, Self-Control 3, Courage 4<br><strong>Path:</strong> Humanity 3<br><strong>@UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.rules-reference.JournalEntry.St7uVm2DqK4nRy8X]{Status} (0):</strong> None<br><strong>Blood:</strong> 10 (may spend 1/round)<br><strong>Willpower:</strong> 6</p>",
